msgctxt "108"
msgid "Please, I've had enough... I'm sorry, okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "120"
msgid "Don't apologize to me. Apologize to the woman you stole from."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132"
msgid "Takashi! I knew you'd be here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "144"
msgid "Grandma!? How'd you find me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "156"
msgid ""
"This has always been your favorite spot to mope and cry whenever anythin' "
"goes wrong. I knew you'd come crawlin' back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "168"
msgid "You... know him?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "180"
msgid ""
"Oh, heavens yes. He's my grandson. Stealin' from your own flesh and blood, "
"Taka... That's just pitiful."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "192"
msgid ""
"You know what? I'll stick you out on your grandfather's boat! That'll "
"adjust yer attitude, eh? Now get over here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "204"
msgid "Granddad's boat? But you know I don't like the ocean!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "228"
msgid "Thanks for the help, young man. Here's a little somethin' for your trouble."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "240"
msgid "You got <Color:8>3,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "252"
msgid "I'm sorry, Grandma! Just please, don't tell Granddad!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "324"
msgid "You got 3,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "336"
msgid "You're the jerk who ran off with a sweet old lady's pension, aren't you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "360"
msgid "Who the hell are you!? I'm not goin' down without a fight!"
msgstr ""

